1
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:10,560
(This story is entirely fictional)
Today, we're honored

2
00:00:10,560 --> 00:00:12,400
to have Mr. Zhang with us,

3
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:14,199
a renowned entrepreneur
and charity donor.

4
00:00:14,359 --> 00:00:15,480
Hello, Mr. Zhang.

5
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:15,759
Hello.

6
00:00:15,759 --> 00:00:18,120
(Interview with Zhang Xiaodong)
We all know

7
00:00:18,199 --> 00:00:19,879
you've always quietly done charity

8
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,199
and helped hundreds of students in need.

9
00:00:22,399 --> 00:00:23,399
What made you

10
00:00:23,399 --> 00:00:25,719
keep doing this all these years?

11
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:29,600
I grew up poor,

12
00:00:29,760 --> 00:00:32,359
so I know the importance
of helping those in need.

13
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:35,359
These kids grew up in the mountains...

14
00:00:35,360 --> 00:00:36,760
(Zhang Xiaodong Interview)
(Based on Doctor Qin: Executer)

15
00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:49,600
(Chasing Dreams on the Plateau)

16
00:01:25,920 --> 00:01:29,040
♪Shadows roll over the girl's wall♪

17
00:01:29,360 --> 00:01:32,440
♪The sunset is nailed to the tombstone♪

18
00:01:32,960 --> 00:01:35,680
♪They say a cat has nine lives♪

19
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:39,560
♪Guess how many lives
I've lived through♪

20
00:01:40,480 --> 00:01:43,440
♪The fluorescent powder
tears the scars open♪

21
00:01:43,840 --> 00:01:45,960
♪Fresh blood feeds the crocodiles♪

22
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:49,960
♪They stroll down the hallway
with smirks♪

23
00:01:50,320 --> 00:01:55,000
♪When the prey breaks free,
the hunter masks up and runs♪

24
00:01:57,200 --> 00:02:00,960
♪Don't ask which hand
I settle scores with♪

25
00:02:01,360 --> 00:02:04,520
♪By the sunflowers,
the cat's eyes will lock on♪

26
00:02:04,800 --> 00:02:07,840
♪Their debts aren't written on paper♪

27
00:02:08,360 --> 00:02:12,760
♪Crocodile tears flow
as the feast begins♪

28
00:02:15,720 --> 00:02:19,520
♪A cat has nine lives,
and keeps a tab on every single one♪

29
00:02:21,639 --> 00:02:22,439
Swim!

30
00:02:22,719 --> 00:02:23,560
Keep swimming!

31
00:02:24,560 --> 00:02:26,360
Swim across and you're free!

32
00:02:29,720 --> 00:02:33,720
=Doctor Qin: Executer=
=Episode 23=

33
00:02:35,639 --> 00:02:36,840
We've examined the body.

34
00:02:37,360 --> 00:02:39,039
His legs and feet

35
00:02:39,280 --> 00:02:40,240
are covered in scratches.

36
00:02:43,080 --> 00:02:44,240
An eye for an eye.

37
00:02:45,680 --> 00:02:49,680
Zhang Xiaodong, Le Tianyi,
and Su Shi are all dead.

38
00:02:49,879 --> 00:02:51,039
You're next.

39
00:03:02,919 --> 00:03:05,039
I didn't get to enjoy
a proper hot pot that day.

40
00:03:05,759 --> 00:03:07,240
That was your birthday, right?

41
00:03:20,639 --> 00:03:23,599
♪Happy birthday to you♪

42
00:03:24,280 --> 00:03:27,159
♪Happy birthday to you♪

43
00:03:27,719 --> 00:03:28,400
♪Happy birthday...♪

44
00:03:28,400 --> 00:03:30,080
(Though none of this was real,)

45
00:03:30,680 --> 00:03:33,360
(thanks for remembering my birthday.)

46
00:03:39,199 --> 00:03:40,000
Make a wish.

47
00:03:52,360 --> 00:03:53,199
So,

48
00:03:54,159 --> 00:03:56,639
I had Qiao Shengchan message Liu Sanhao

49
00:03:57,360 --> 00:03:58,560
and lure him to the rooftop.

50
00:03:59,360 --> 00:04:02,039
Qiao Shengchan was the easiest pawn.

51
00:04:02,479 --> 00:04:03,280
Of course,

52
00:04:04,120 --> 00:04:06,280
he was also the step
most likely to go wrong.

53
00:04:07,360 --> 00:04:10,000
A simple-minded, muscle-bound thug

54
00:04:10,439 --> 00:04:11,599
is the easiest to turn

55
00:04:12,240 --> 00:04:13,800
into a madman driven by hatred.

56
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:29,519
(While Qiao Shengchan was in prison,)

57
00:04:29,519 --> 00:04:31,279
(doing time for Liu Sanhao,)

58
00:04:31,959 --> 00:04:33,480
(I planted eyes for him)

59
00:04:33,519 --> 00:04:35,519
(at Liu's restaurant)

60
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:38,399
(so he could see for himself)

61
00:04:38,759 --> 00:04:40,160
(how his buddy treated his wife.)

62
00:04:40,879 --> 00:04:42,680
(So you planted that camera?)

63
00:04:46,360 --> 00:04:47,920
(When you have a hungry beast,)

64
00:04:47,920 --> 00:04:50,199
(you just point it toward its prey.)

65
00:04:51,680 --> 00:04:52,959
Then sit back

66
00:04:53,199 --> 00:04:55,279
and enjoy the carnage.

67
00:04:55,959 --> 00:04:58,040
(I handled everything
for Qiao's mother,)

68
00:04:58,040 --> 00:04:59,079
(from treatment to funeral.)

69
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:01,959
(Before she died,
she authorized me to visit Qiao.)

70
00:05:02,079 --> 00:05:03,199
Liu Sanhao!

71
00:05:03,439 --> 00:05:04,600
Liu Sanhao!

72
00:05:04,680 --> 00:05:06,360
I'll chop you into pieces!

73
00:05:09,040 --> 00:05:10,079
(Chop him?)

74
00:05:11,480 --> 00:05:12,639
(Just killing him)

75
00:05:12,800 --> 00:05:13,959
(would be too easy.)

76
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:15,839
Then what should I do?

77
00:05:17,040 --> 00:05:19,240
(Murder's the cheapest kind of revenge.)

78
00:05:20,639 --> 00:05:21,639
(Don't you want to see)

79
00:05:21,639 --> 00:05:23,600
(the look on his face)

80
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:25,279
(when he finds himself all alone?)

81
00:05:25,920 --> 00:05:27,800
(Don't you want to hear him)

82
00:05:27,920 --> 00:05:29,959
(begging for mercy like a dog?)

83
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:31,160
(Don't you want to watch him)

84
00:05:31,160 --> 00:05:33,319
(toss and turn helplessly)

85
00:05:33,519 --> 00:05:34,720
(in a hot pot,)

86
00:05:34,920 --> 00:05:36,000
(until he's cooked through?)

87
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:36,639
I do.

88
00:05:37,920 --> 00:05:38,879
I've dreamed of it.

89
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:41,680
(Then let's give him)

90
00:05:42,319 --> 00:05:44,040
(a taste of boiling oil.)

91
00:05:45,560 --> 00:05:46,439
I'll follow your lead.

92
00:05:47,000 --> 00:05:47,959
Tell me what to do,

93
00:05:49,040 --> 00:05:50,040
and I'll do it.

94
00:06:25,920 --> 00:06:27,800
You don't need to say anything.

95
00:06:28,120 --> 00:06:30,079
He's already a revenge-crazed lunatic.

96
00:06:30,399 --> 00:06:31,199
Was Liu Sanhao

97
00:06:32,279 --> 00:06:33,639
thrown off the building by you?

98
00:06:45,680 --> 00:06:46,600
That homemade gun

99
00:06:48,279 --> 00:06:49,240
was made by him too?

100
00:06:50,560 --> 00:06:51,399
Officer Qin.

101
00:06:54,360 --> 00:06:55,600
When you fired the first shot,

102
00:06:57,240 --> 00:06:58,720
did you really want to kill me?

103
00:07:04,759 --> 00:07:06,199
When I picked up that gun,

104
00:07:06,480 --> 00:07:08,120
I realized it was homemade.

105
00:07:08,560 --> 00:07:10,120
Gunmakers all know

106
00:07:10,720 --> 00:07:13,000
this kind of gun
can't shoot straight at a distance.

107
00:07:13,480 --> 00:07:14,279
So...

108
00:07:14,639 --> 00:07:15,920
I aimed somewhere else.

109
00:07:16,759 --> 00:07:18,040
I wanted to stall for time.

110
00:07:22,079 --> 00:07:24,040
So there was a second choice after all.

111
00:08:10,879 --> 00:08:12,120
Let's stop here for today.

112
00:08:29,680 --> 00:08:34,360
(Police)

113
00:08:44,520 --> 00:08:48,040
(Resistance Brings Harsher Treatment)

114
00:08:56,080 --> 00:08:56,919
Officer Qin.

115
00:09:00,080 --> 00:09:01,799
Can I ask you a favor?

116
00:09:05,840 --> 00:09:07,399
Please take care of Ms. Song.

117
00:09:09,240 --> 00:09:10,039
Thank you.

118
00:09:37,240 --> 00:09:39,679
Jin Keke confessed to all the facts,

119
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:42,000
including how she incited Su Tang,

120
00:09:42,039 --> 00:09:43,159
suborned Qiao Shengchan,

121
00:09:43,159 --> 00:09:44,879
and hired Su Qingchen's father.

122
00:09:45,039 --> 00:09:48,360
(Longfan Police)
Her aid to Su Qingchen and Xu Meng

123
00:09:48,919 --> 00:09:49,799
was verified

124
00:09:49,799 --> 00:09:51,159
to be illegal gains

125
00:09:51,159 --> 00:09:52,879
from extorting Mr. Wang.

126
00:09:53,159 --> 00:09:55,039
We've started recovery proceedings.

127
00:09:55,440 --> 00:09:57,559
Given Su Qingchen's situation,

128
00:09:57,759 --> 00:09:59,159
if we recover the money,

129
00:09:59,320 --> 00:10:00,240
what will happen to her?

130
00:10:00,679 --> 00:10:02,440
On the civil damages side,

131
00:10:02,639 --> 00:10:04,960
we're working with legal aid services

132
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:06,679
to help her file a separate lawsuit

133
00:10:06,679 --> 00:10:08,600
against Liu Sanhao's heirs.

134
00:10:08,759 --> 00:10:10,519
(Longfan Police)
The follow-up evidence

135
00:10:10,559 --> 00:10:12,080
and prosecution work must keep up.

136
00:10:13,200 --> 00:10:14,480
(Longfan Police)

137
00:10:14,480 --> 00:10:15,639
Good work, everyone.

138
00:10:15,840 --> 00:10:17,360
When it's done,

139
00:10:18,080 --> 00:10:19,440
I'll treat you all properly.

140
00:10:22,720 --> 00:10:24,279
Mr. Dong, one more thing.

141
00:10:24,919 --> 00:10:27,000
Throughout these cases,

142
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:29,639
Jin Keke kept appearing on our radar,

143
00:10:30,039 --> 00:10:32,240
more or less connected to them.

144
00:10:32,240 --> 00:10:33,200
However,

145
00:10:33,200 --> 00:10:35,960
we repeatedly ruled her out.

146
00:10:36,039 --> 00:10:38,159
That's because our investigation showed

147
00:10:38,279 --> 00:10:40,480
she had a solid alibi

148
00:10:40,480 --> 00:10:42,679
and insufficient time
to commit the crimes.

149
00:10:45,639 --> 00:10:46,440
I believe

150
00:10:46,919 --> 00:10:48,639
Jin Keke told us most of the truth.

151
00:10:48,759 --> 00:10:50,960
But she must be hiding something.

152
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:52,360
There are still doubts in this case.

153
00:10:52,759 --> 00:10:54,039
We shouldn't rush to close it.

154
00:10:57,919 --> 00:10:59,080
You have a point.

155
00:11:01,240 --> 00:11:02,639
We need to keep securing evidence.

156
00:11:04,600 --> 00:11:06,120
(Notes)
Su Shi was killed by a lefty,

157
00:11:06,120 --> 00:11:07,360
but Su Tang wasn't one.

158
00:11:07,840 --> 00:11:09,240
And the drone at Liu's death scene

159
00:11:09,240 --> 00:11:10,240
wasn't operated

160
00:11:10,240 --> 00:11:11,720
by Su Qingchen or her father.

161
00:11:12,120 --> 00:11:12,919
Then who was it?

162
00:11:13,200 --> 00:11:14,919
Jin Keke didn't have a remote control.

163
00:11:16,279 --> 00:11:17,720
She has several accomplices.

164
00:11:18,000 --> 00:11:18,879
Zhang Lanfen

165
00:11:18,879 --> 00:11:20,360
is basically confirmed to be one.

166
00:11:20,559 --> 00:11:21,919
She released false information

167
00:11:22,120 --> 00:11:23,879
just to stall for time.

168
00:11:23,919 --> 00:11:25,879
Even if Jin Keke planned everything,

169
00:11:26,480 --> 00:11:27,840
she'd still need a capable right hand.

170
00:11:28,080 --> 00:11:28,879
There's an executor

171
00:11:30,080 --> 00:11:32,440
who's been hiding in the shadows.

172
00:11:32,600 --> 00:11:34,279
They're the real ghost.

173
00:11:34,519 --> 00:11:36,440
Jin Keke may only be

174
00:11:37,039 --> 00:11:38,240
part of the Executer.

175
00:11:38,559 --> 00:11:39,360
You mean

176
00:11:39,720 --> 00:11:41,360
there's someone else behind Jin Keke?

177
00:11:41,440 --> 00:11:42,240
Exactly.

178
00:11:42,720 --> 00:11:43,480
A person like that

179
00:11:43,480 --> 00:11:45,279
needs to meet several conditions.

180
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:47,679
First, they have enough free time.

181
00:11:47,919 --> 00:11:50,360
Second, they're good
at avoiding detection.

182
00:11:50,559 --> 00:11:51,360
Third,

183
00:11:51,639 --> 00:11:53,039
and most importantly,

184
00:11:53,600 --> 00:11:55,320
they must have Jin Keke's deep trust,

185
00:11:55,720 --> 00:11:56,519
even to the point

186
00:11:56,919 --> 00:11:59,039
of obeying their orders unconditionally.

187
00:12:00,440 --> 00:12:01,840
Someone she trusts most...

188
00:12:02,320 --> 00:12:03,159
Who else could it be?

189
00:12:07,600 --> 00:12:10,120
(Su Tang admitted
she had a desire to kill.)

190
00:12:10,480 --> 00:12:12,120
(She took an overdose of drugs.)

191
00:12:12,120 --> 00:12:13,279
(Her memories were confused.)

192
00:12:13,879 --> 00:12:14,919
(When she woke up,)

193
00:12:15,039 --> 00:12:16,360
(she found the knife in her own hand,)

194
00:12:16,360 --> 00:12:18,440
(so she believed she'd killed Su Shi.)

195
00:12:18,679 --> 00:12:19,440
(Also,)

196
00:12:19,679 --> 00:12:21,919
She doesn't remember
placing the sunflowers on the body.

197
00:12:21,919 --> 00:12:23,960
Le Tianyi wore gloves
at the cat shelter,

198
00:12:24,240 --> 00:12:25,879
but that fingerprint was so clear.

199
00:12:26,120 --> 00:12:27,879
Obviously, someone left it on purpose.

200
00:12:28,320 --> 00:12:29,840
But in Jin Keke's statement,

201
00:12:29,879 --> 00:12:30,919
she never mentioned it.

202
00:12:31,080 --> 00:12:32,919
Zhang Lanfen felt sympathy for Jin Keke,

203
00:12:33,200 --> 00:12:34,759
so she painted those portraits.

204
00:12:34,879 --> 00:12:35,799
Her being found in the bag

205
00:12:35,799 --> 00:12:37,360
was also part of their plan,

206
00:12:37,480 --> 00:12:39,080
all to mislead us.

207
00:12:39,159 --> 00:12:40,120
Wang Xuan

208
00:12:40,120 --> 00:12:41,240
won't spit a thing.

209
00:12:41,399 --> 00:12:44,559
Zhang Lanfen, Wang Xuan, and Su Tang
were all in the hospital that day.

210
00:12:45,240 --> 00:12:46,759
So who sent me the letter?

211
00:12:54,240 --> 00:12:55,600
I've been misled

212
00:12:55,600 --> 00:12:56,440
by that photo I took.

213
00:12:57,000 --> 00:12:58,440
I assumed

214
00:12:58,519 --> 00:13:00,320
the sunflowers were tied to Jin Keke.

215
00:13:01,240 --> 00:13:02,080
However,

216
00:13:02,240 --> 00:13:04,039
the true meaning behind it is...

217
00:13:10,200 --> 00:13:11,080
Song Yalan?

218
00:13:11,320 --> 00:13:12,320
You mean

219
00:13:12,480 --> 00:13:14,360
an old lady with Alzheimer's?

220
00:13:14,759 --> 00:13:15,879
Alzheimer's

221
00:13:16,559 --> 00:13:18,080
might just be a disguise.

222
00:13:18,799 --> 00:13:20,720
Jin vanished after she dropped out.

223
00:13:21,159 --> 00:13:23,039
So why suddenly start seeking revenge?

224
00:13:23,519 --> 00:13:25,440
And she's been living with Song Yalan.

225
00:13:25,799 --> 00:13:27,440
Don't you find that strange?

226
00:13:28,279 --> 00:13:30,519
(Mom, I miss you.)

227
00:13:30,919 --> 00:13:32,240
(How have you been?)

228
00:13:33,240 --> 00:13:35,039
Jin planned such a massacre

229
00:13:35,080 --> 00:13:36,559
under Song Yalan's roof.

230
00:13:36,559 --> 00:13:38,919
Could Song really have noticed nothing?

231
00:13:39,480 --> 00:13:41,159
Song Yalan is Xia Wen's mother.

232
00:13:41,480 --> 00:13:43,879
Why was Xia Wen's case never solved?

233
00:13:44,080 --> 00:13:45,320
I read the file before.

234
00:13:45,519 --> 00:13:47,120
A huge rainstorm hit later,

235
00:13:47,559 --> 00:13:49,200
destroying all the evidence.

236
00:13:49,200 --> 00:13:50,559
The suburbs were barely monitored

237
00:13:50,559 --> 00:13:51,600
back then.

238
00:13:52,240 --> 00:13:53,320
They investigated for a long time,

239
00:13:53,399 --> 00:13:54,519
but got nowhere.

240
00:13:54,879 --> 00:13:56,360
Eventually, it was listed
as a cold case.

241
00:13:56,720 --> 00:13:57,919
Let's think differently.

242
00:13:58,159 --> 00:13:59,559
What if the mastermind

243
00:14:00,039 --> 00:14:01,120
is Song Yalan?

244
00:15:10,320 --> 00:15:11,519
From these bits of information,

245
00:15:11,879 --> 00:15:13,440
she could figure out three things.

246
00:15:13,879 --> 00:15:14,679
First,

247
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:16,480
her daughter's death was no accident.

248
00:15:16,720 --> 00:15:17,519
Second,

249
00:15:18,240 --> 00:15:19,679
Jin Keke was involved.

250
00:15:20,159 --> 00:15:20,960
Third,

251
00:15:21,519 --> 00:15:22,960
a pervert named Mr. Zhang

252
00:15:22,960 --> 00:15:24,559
is the source of all evil.

253
00:15:25,120 --> 00:15:26,679
A mother who lost her child

254
00:15:27,080 --> 00:15:29,240
would never let it go so easily.

255
00:15:35,840 --> 00:15:39,400
(Interview with Zhang Xiaodong,
Renowned Entrepreneur and Donor)

256
00:15:40,399 --> 00:15:41,399
(A determined mother)

257
00:15:41,399 --> 00:15:43,159
(finding out how her daughter died)

258
00:15:43,399 --> 00:15:45,440
(can become the greatest detective.)

259
00:15:45,840 --> 00:15:47,080
(She didn't go to the police)

260
00:15:47,120 --> 00:15:48,080
(because she knew)

261
00:15:48,679 --> 00:15:50,559
(a mysterious USB drive)

262
00:15:50,600 --> 00:15:52,320
(and some names from hearsay)

263
00:15:52,679 --> 00:15:53,480
(could never)

264
00:15:53,480 --> 00:15:55,039
(take down a powerful figure.)

265
00:15:55,879 --> 00:15:57,519
(So she chose the dumbest way instead.)

266
00:15:58,320 --> 00:15:59,279
(In the dark alone,)

267
00:15:59,279 --> 00:16:01,080
(she drew up that map of evil.)

268
00:16:23,879 --> 00:16:24,679
Mr. Han.

269
00:16:26,039 --> 00:16:27,720
Records show
Song Yalan was a chemical engineer

270
00:16:27,720 --> 00:16:29,360
before she became a teacher.

271
00:16:37,480 --> 00:16:38,240
She's a lefty.

272
00:16:38,639 --> 00:16:39,440
Oh, right.

273
00:16:39,440 --> 00:16:41,440
Her name's also on the staff list

274
00:16:41,440 --> 00:16:42,919
of Liu Sanhao's restaurant.

275
00:16:56,759 --> 00:16:57,720
That's no coincidence.

276
00:16:57,720 --> 00:16:59,519
Ou Wen, let's go. To Song Yalan's house.

277
00:17:07,200 --> 00:17:08,080
(Serve the People)

278
00:17:08,080 --> 00:17:09,640
(Guard the Homeland, Stay Ever Vigilant)

279
00:17:11,160 --> 00:17:12,480
(Police)

280
00:17:15,920 --> 00:17:16,720
(Stay Ever Vigilant)

281
00:17:16,720 --> 00:17:18,000
(Guard the Homeland)

282
00:17:21,000 --> 00:17:22,760
(Longfan Police)

283
00:17:28,519 --> 00:17:30,480
Dr. Qin, this package came this morning.

284
00:17:30,480 --> 00:17:31,960
I brought it over for you.

285
00:17:35,480 --> 00:17:36,960
But I haven't bought anything recently.

286
00:17:40,039 --> 00:17:41,279
Did you do the bomb check?

287
00:17:41,680 --> 00:17:43,039
Security already did it.

288
00:17:44,480 --> 00:17:49,080
♪Moonlight soaks the withered sunflower♪

289
00:17:49,880 --> 00:17:53,880
♪Fingerprints seal the verdict♪

290
00:17:55,920 --> 00:18:00,600
♪Good deeds bloom from lies♪

291
00:18:01,080 --> 00:18:05,360
♪Who's next nailed to this wall?♪

292
00:18:10,040 --> 00:18:13,480
♪The Executer is never late♪

293
00:18:13,880 --> 00:18:15,400
(The Last Lesson)

294
00:18:15,480 --> 00:18:17,759
♪Every sin will be paid for♪

295
00:18:17,759 --> 00:18:19,480
(Phenolphthalein has seen red)

296
00:18:19,759 --> 00:18:21,880
(so it forgets
colorless is also an answer.)

297
00:18:22,319 --> 00:18:24,119
(I taught countless neutralizations)

298
00:18:24,240 --> 00:18:25,559
(but never taught myself.)

299
00:18:26,720 --> 00:18:28,559
(If love doesn't cross the line,)

300
00:18:28,559 --> 00:18:30,079
(it's the gentlest knife.)

301
00:18:30,759 --> 00:18:32,640
(From that night ten years ago,)

302
00:18:33,200 --> 00:18:35,480
(from the moment
she was let out the door,)

303
00:18:35,960 --> 00:18:38,319
(the verdict took effect.)

304
00:18:38,640 --> 00:18:43,680
♪In the shredder,
peace and equality are found♪

305
00:18:49,040 --> 00:18:53,270
♪Sunset washes over the old wall♪

306
00:18:53,800 --> 00:18:58,140
♪Milk tea cools on the stone steps♪

307
00:18:58,140 --> 00:19:02,140
♪Sea wind tugs at your sleeve♪

308
00:19:02,630 --> 00:19:06,490
♪Unspoken words just flee and fade♪

309
00:19:15,470 --> 00:19:19,380
♪The marks on the desk
have faded yellow♪

310
00:19:19,380 --> 00:19:22,360
♪I turned around,
and a gunshot rang out♪

311
00:19:22,880 --> 00:19:26,500
♪No one can truly feel another's pain♪

312
00:19:26,500 --> 00:19:30,730
♪The wind is cold,
a fading shadow sways♪

313
00:19:30,730 --> 00:19:35,450
♪Tonight, I don't care
about the universe♪

314
00:19:35,450 --> 00:19:39,600
♪I only want to see this through
with you♪

315
00:19:40,470 --> 00:19:44,250
♪A bullet pierces the spring night♪

316
00:19:44,250 --> 00:19:48,340
♪You sink into the vast crowd♪

317
00:19:57,300 --> 00:20:01,510
♪Years later, when we meet again♪

318
00:20:01,510 --> 00:20:05,850
♪Don't mention this moonlit night♪

319
00:20:05,850 --> 00:20:09,620
♪The waves smooth
two lines of footprints♪

320
00:20:09,620 --> 00:20:12,520
♪Half a cup of sweetness
sinks into the sand♪

321
00:20:12,520 --> 00:20:17,310
♪Tonight, I don't care
about the universe♪

322
00:20:17,310 --> 00:20:21,960
♪I only want to see this through
with you♪

323
00:20:21,960 --> 00:20:24,220
♪Wind back to shore,
clouds back to hills♪

324
00:20:24,220 --> 00:20:26,360
♪We stop here in this night♪

325
00:20:26,360 --> 00:20:30,780
♪This is the past, the only,
the last look back♪

326
00:20:30,780 --> 00:20:36,760
♪One gunshot echoes through half a life♪

327
00:20:39,180 --> 00:20:45,520
♪One gunshot echoes through half a life♪

328
00:20:57,040 --> 00:21:03,970
♪One gunshot echoes through half a life♪

329
00:21:06,220 --> 00:21:11,920
♪One gunshot echoes through half a life♪
